            <ArticleTitle>Clinical management where medicine meets management. Full team ahead.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Redesigning the diabetes team has meant national service framework targets have been hit. A trained technician has proved as adept in the diabetes review role as clinicians. The role of technician could be adapted to different specialties, such as asthma and coronary heart disease.</AbstractText>
